  "bookId": "GAL",
  "reference": "Abagalasia 4",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningamba nti: Omusika orwo aba akyali mwana taina ky'akiza mwiru, n'orwo eitunga lyona aba ali mukama walyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba akyali omu mikono y'abalezi, n'eitunga liba likyali omu mikono yabo balikwasire kuhika kiro ekyo ishe yasigire yaragira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naichwe kutyo, orwo twabaire tukyali baana bato twabaga bairu b'amasitani agatwara ensi egi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe k'obukiro bwagobire Ruhanga yatuma Omwanawe, Omwanawe ogwo akazarwa omukazi, mara nawe yaragirwa kuhondera Amateka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuchungura ababaire nibatwarwa Amateka tubone kuhinduka baana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba muli baanabe. Ruhanga akatuma Mwoyo wa Mwanawe omu mitima yaitu, akaija nayeta ati, “Aba! Tata!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo omu mani ga Ruhanga iwe tokili mwiru, wabaire mwana, kandi k'oli mwana aho oli musika wa Ruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eirai orwo mutamanyaga Ruhanga mwabaga bairu ba baruhanga abatali ba mazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai mbwenu orwo mwamanyire Ruhanga, anga nti Ruhanga wenene yabamanyire, mwakushuba mugaruka mutai aha michwo etaina kwo eli eya katozi? Nimugonza kushuba kuba bairu bayo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimumanya ebiro, n'emyezi, n'ebirumo, n'emyaka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nintina, ebyo nabakoleire amani gange gakafa bushai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barumuna bange, nimbatagiliza munshushe, kuba nanye mbashusiire. Timwankozire kubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimumanya okwo orwo nabarangiire evangeli elya mbere ni kuba nkaba ndwaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai n'orwo kili kityo okurwara kwange kukaba kilengeso ahali inywe. Kandi timwanjumire anga kungaya. Mukantora oti ndi mumalaika wa Ruhanga, oti ndi Yesu Kirisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukaba mushemeleirwe! Mbwenu kandi mubaireki? Inye nimbajulira okwo rulinya, kuba kyabaire nikishoboka, mwakwenonkoiremu n'amaisho mugampa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu kambagambire amazima naba mubisha wanyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abandi nibezora kubagonza muno, kyonkai omugendelero gwabo ti gurungi. Nibagonza kubanyihyaho, ngu mwije mubagonze nk'okwo bonene bagondize inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwona rwona okugonzibwa kuba kurungi, nangu kutaba orwo ndi hamoi nainywe, kyonkaisi mugonzibwe aha rw'ebirungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twana twange, mulebe mushubire mwanshasa nk'omukazi alikurumwa kuhika orwo mulishobokerwa Kirisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakugondize kuba ndi hamoi nainywe mbwenu aha nkahinduramu eiraka, aha rw'okuba mwanshobeza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungambire inywe abalikwegomba kutwarwa Amateka, isi ebyo Amateka galikugamba timulikubihulira? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba kikahandikwa okwo Aburahamu yabaire aina abaana b'abojo babili, omoi namuzara aha muzana, ondijo namuzara aha mukazi omwegeleere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana w'obwojo w'omuzana omu mani g'omubili. Kyonkai omwana w'obwojo ow'omukazi omwegelere akazarwa aha rw'enshonga y'endagano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egi migambire: Abakazi aba bombili ndagano ibili. Endagano emoi neruga aha Ibanga lya Sinai, netabukwamu abairu; niwe Hagari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu Hagari niwe Ibanga lya Sina omuli Arabia, niwe omoi na Yerusalemu eya kanya aka, aha rw'okuba wenene n'abaanabe bali omu bwiru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Yerusalemu ey'oruguru egyo y'obwegeleere, mara ogwo muzaire, ni nyinabantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nobona kikahandikwa kiti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
